-/// Two kilohertz is the hinge of the speech spectrum: the first two formants and
-/// nearly all the power sit below it, and consonants, breath and air sit above.
-/// Every path that costs a voice its intelligibility — distance, a wall, a door,
-/// a head turned away, a capsule pointing elsewhere — takes the upper half down
